  "generated_text": "First, we rewrite the given equation:\n\\[\n56x^2 + 27  89 -  88\n\n\n\\[\n56x^2 - 89x + 35 = 0\n\\]\n\nNext, we factor thex \n\n\\[\n(7x - 5)(8x - 7) = 0\n\\]\n\nNow, we set each factor equal to zero and solve for $x$:):\n\\[\n7x -  \\ \\quad \\ \\ \\ \\ \\  \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\boxed \\frac{7}{8}\n\\]",
